# Currrent commands and their functions:
# #############################################################################
# '#' lets you comment inside a vns file, line gets ignored
# 'enter [character name] [sprite name] [position] [sprite scale]'
#	creates a character with a sprite, who then appears on screen in [position]
#	sprite scale is used to change the size of sprites so they fit the screen better
# 'exit [character name]' removes [characetr name] from the scene
# 'setsprite [character name] [sprite name]' sets the current sprite of [character name] to [sprite name]
# 'clear text' removes all dialouge on screen
# 'textspeed [speed]' sets the scroll speed of dialouge to [speed]
# 'wait [seconds]' causes the program to wait [seconds] before any further action
# 'choice [num] [opt n] [text n]...' 
#	creates [num] number of on screen buttons that represent user choices
#	each choice corresponds to [opt n] and contains [text n]
# 'reply' [text] a custom choice with a single option only
# 'setbackground [background]' changes the background to [background]
# 'jumpto [choice]' sets the current script line to [choice], which is defined as ':[choice name]'
# 'playsong [song name]' starts playing [song]
# 'pausesong' pauses the current song playing
# 'resumesong' resumes the current song playing
# 'stopsong' stops the current song playing
# 'play [character name] [animation name] [time]
#	plays [animation name] for [character name] over a defined [time]
# #############################################################################

